          {
            "text": "This value was obtained via an informal inter-provider information request: Dr. Sollecito asked Dr. Teh Lin (FCCC Medical Physics) on 2026-07-23 for site-specific dose data at tooth #30, extracted from the IMRT treatment plan already ordered in Interaction 1. Per project design decision, this request/response exchange is modeled as a note (this one), not as a formal ServiceRequest or CommunicationRequest/Communication — see fhir-resources/uc01-medical-to-dental/interactions/README.md for the full reasoning (a confirmed, legitimate instance of the base Clinical Order Workflows IG's 'Requesting additional information' pattern, which is not carried into the 360X-scoped crosswalk this project's referral pathway otherwise follows). Data transmitted 2026-07-25, two days after the request — this transmission date is not modeled as its own clinical encounter (see use case Appendix Section 0)."
          }
        ]
      },
